---
config:
  theme: neo
description: >-
  Label icons (@mermaid-js/plugin-icons, I3 #324) in state descriptions, a transition, a
  composite title and a note, in the neo theme. fa:fa-bell is filled with currentColor, fal:fa-
  circle-check stroked with it: both take the label's text colour, so the four theme families
  differ by colour only (D215, D227).
---
stateDiagram-v2
  Idle : fa:fa-bell waiting
  Idle --> Ringing : fal:fa-circle-check press
  state "fa:fa-bell Ringing" as Ringing {
    Loud : fal:fa-circle-check loud
  }
  note right of Idle
    fa:fa-bell quiet
  end note
